  displayName: Medical Dismissal
  type: Conspiracy
  text: Your doctor will tell you to just 'eat less and move more'. That's what they're
    paid to say. Here's what really works.
  debunkingText: "\uFFFDThis is an \"Us vs. Them\" conspiracy. It tries to create
    complete distrust in the entire medical profession to position the guru as the
    only one with the \"real\" answers."
